217: /**
218:  * Formats the string representing a date, including partial representations of dates, according to the current
219:  * locale and the given options.
220:  *
221:  * Default options:
222:  *  - mode: "standard",
223:  *  - time: "for today",
224:  *  - day: true,
225:  *  - month: true,
226:  *  - year: true
